LearnPath AI 🎓
AI-powered Student Segmentation & Personalized Course Recommendation
LearnPath AI is an educational machine-learning portfolio project. It segments learners using K-Means clustering and ranks courses with a transparent hybrid recommendation score.
Features
• K-Means clustering on student learning behaviour
• Student segment profiles and analytics
• Personalized course ranking using interest, career goal, skill level and course rating
• Interactive Streamlit dashboard
• Synthetic sample datasets
• Automated tests
Tech stack
Python · Pandas · NumPy · Scikit-learn · Streamlit · Plotly · Pytest
